---
import HoldingLayout from '../layouts/HoldingLayout.astro';

const source120Url = 'https://source120.com';
---

<HoldingLayout
  title="Meon Valley Web is becoming Source 120"
  description="Meon Valley Web is becoming Source 120. The same person, experience and care, with a broader home for the work."
>
  <div class="holding-page">
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Meon Valley Web home">
        <img src="/meon-valley-web-logo.svg" alt="Meon Valley Web" width="224" height="58" />
      </a>
      <a class="new-home" href={source120Url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span>Now building as</span>
        <strong>Source 120 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong>
      </a>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Meon Valley Web</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">The name is changing. The work carries on.</h1>
          <p class="hero-lede">Meon Valley Web is becoming Source 120. The same person, experience and care, with a broader home for the work.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href={source120Url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Source 120 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="mailto:hello@meonvalleyweb.com">Email Andrew</a>
          </div>
          <p class="transition-note">This address and the Meon Valley Web email remain active while the move is completed.</p>
        </div>

        <figure class="hero-art">
          <div class="hero-art-frame">
            <img
              src="/rebrand-transition.webp"
              alt="A charcoal folded card, raspberry paper ribbon and white arrow suggesting a new direction"
              width="1448"
              height="1086"
              fetchpriority="high"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption>Same care. A wider frame.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="continuity" aria-labelledby="continuity-title">
        <div class="section-intro">
          <h2 id="continuity-title">A new name. The same way of working.</h2>
          <p>I started Meon Valley Web to make good websites feel more straightforward. That remains the point. Source 120 gives the work a home that can grow beyond one valley.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="continuity-list">
          <article>
            <h3>Useful first</h3>
            <p>Websites built around the job they need to do, not a stack of features.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Support after launch</h3>
            <p>Clear advice, practical fixes and someone who knows the work when you need help.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Time for good causes</h3>
            <p>Charity and community work remain part of the reason I do this.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-band" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">For existing contacts</p>
          <h2 id="contact-title">Keep the old address. Follow the new one.</h2>
          <p>You can still reach Andrew at <a href="mailto:hello@meonvalleyweb.com">hello@meonvalleyweb.com</a>. New work and the next chapter are now at Source 120.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link" href={source120Url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See the new site <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div>
        <p class="footer-brand">Meon Valley Web</p>
        <p class="footer-note">Moving to Source 120. The domain remains active for email while the transition is completed.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:hello@meonvalleyweb.com">hello@meonvalleyweb.com</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</HoldingLayout>

<style>
  .holding-page {
    --ink: #15171c;
    --muted: #5b5e66;
    --line: rgba(21, 23, 28, 0.16);
    --paper: #f6f4ef;
    --paper-deep: #ece9e2;
    --pink: #bc1f63;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .site-header,
  .hero,
  .continuity,
  .contact-band,
  .site-footer {
    width: min(100% - 3rem, 78rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .site-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 6.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 14rem;
  }

  .brand img {
    display: block;
    width: auto;
    height: 2.7rem;
  }

  .new-home {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .new-home span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .new-home strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: color 180ms ease;
  }

  .new-home:hover strong,
  .new-home:focus-visible strong {
    color: var(--pink);
  }

  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.86fr) minmax(0, 1.14fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    min-height: min(47rem, calc(100dvh - 6.5rem));
    padding: 4.5rem 0 5.5rem;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 35rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--pink);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 6.2vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 0.96;
  }

  .hero-lede {
    max-width: 31rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 3.25rem;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.35rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 180ms ease, background-color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
  }

  .button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .button:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: var(--pink);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .button-primary:hover,
  .button-primary:focus-visible {
    background: #8f1749;
  }

  .button-secondary {
    border-color: var(--line);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .button-secondary:hover,
  .button-secondary:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--ink);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
  }

  .transition-note {
    max-width: 27rem;
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    color: #777a80;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .hero-art {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-art-frame {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--paper-deep);
    box-shadow: 0 2.5rem 5rem -3rem rgba(21, 23, 28, 0.42);
  }

  .hero-art-frame::after {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(21, 23, 28, 0.12);
    border-radius: inherit;
    content: '';
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-art img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .continuity {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(18rem, 0.75fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 6.5rem 0;
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 31rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .section-intro p,
  .contact-band p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .continuity-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .continuity-list article {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 1.45rem 0 1.6rem;
  }

  .continuity-list h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .continuity-list p {
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .contact-band {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .contact-band h2,
  .contact-band p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: #f7f4ed;
  }

  .contact-band h2 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .contact-band p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 39rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .contact-band a:not(.text-link) {
    color: #f5a7c8;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .text-link {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-underline-offset: 0.3rem;
  }

  .text-link:hover,
  .text-link:focus-visible {
    color: #f5a7c8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .site-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 5rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .footer-note {
    max-width: 27rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .site-footer > a {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .hero-copy,
    .hero-art {
      animation: enter 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both;
    }

    .hero-art {
      animation-delay: 120ms;
    }

    @keyframes enter {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(1.25rem);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .site-header,
    .hero,
    .continuity,
    .contact-band,
    .site-footer {
      width: min(100% - 2rem, 42rem);
    }

    .site-header {
      min-height: 5.5rem;
    }

    .brand img {
      height: 2.2rem;
    }

    .new-home span {
      font-size: 0.61rem;
    }

    .new-home strong {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .hero {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 3rem;
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 4rem 0 4.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 9ch;
      font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 15vw, 5rem);
    }

    .hero-art {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .continuity {
      display: block;
      padding: 4.5rem 0;
    }

    .continuity-list {
      margin-top: 2.75rem;
    }

    .contact-band {
      display: block;
    }

    .text-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .site-footer {
      display: block;
      padding-top: 4rem;
    }

    .site-footer > a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
